{
  "version": 1,
  "project": "wantai-dev/013-whosundercover",
  "runner": "ubuntu-latest",
  "install": [
    {
      "command": [
        "env",
        "COREPACK_ENABLE_AUTO_PIN=0",
        "COREPACK_HOME=.local/development-ci/corepack",
        "corepack",
        "pnpm@10.20.0",
        "install",
        "--frozen-lockfile",
        "--ignore-scripts"
      ],
      "cwd": "."
    }
  ],
  "checks": [
    {
      "id": "eslint",
      "paths": [
        "src/**",
        "*.js",
        "*.ts",
        "*.tsx",
        "package.json",
        "pnpm-lock.yaml",
        "eslint.config.*"
      ],
      "command": [
        "env",
        "COREPACK_ENABLE_AUTO_PIN=0",
        "COREPACK_HOME=.local/development-ci/corepack",
        "corepack",
        "pnpm@10.20.0",
        "run",
        "lint"
      ],
      "cwd": "."
    },
    {
      "id": "build",
      "paths": [
        "src/**",
        "public/**",
        "index.html",
        "package.json",
        "pnpm-lock.yaml",
        "tsconfig*.json",
        "vite.config.*"
      ],
      "command": [
        "env",
        "COREPACK_ENABLE_AUTO_PIN=0",
        "COREPACK_HOME=.local/development-ci/corepack",
        "corepack",
        "pnpm@10.20.0",
        "run",
        "build"
      ],
      "cwd": "."
    },
    {
      "id": "offline-game-rules",
      "paths": [
        "src/lib/**",
        "vite.config.*",
        "package.json",
        "pnpm-lock.yaml"
      ],
      "command": [
        "env",
        "COREPACK_ENABLE_AUTO_PIN=0",
        "COREPACK_HOME=.local/development-ci/corepack",
        "corepack",
        "pnpm@10.20.0",
        "exec",
        "vitest",
        "run",
        "src/lib/gameRules.test.ts",
        "src/lib/offlineGame.test.ts"
      ],
      "cwd": "."
    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    "命令来源：package.json lint/build/test及src/lib/gameRules.test.ts、offlineGame.test.ts。",
    "采用pnpm-lock.yaml（lockfileVersion 9.0），通过Corepack固定pnpm@10.20.0；COREPACK_ENABLE_AUTO_PIN=0禁止自动改写package.json，COREPACK_HOME=.local/development-ci/corepack将缓存限定到仓库受管目录。所有命令工作目录均为仓库根目录；不回退到无锁npm。",
    "选定测试仅内存离线游戏规则，不调用Supabase，不代表联网多人房间、RLS或生产验收。",
    "pnpm@10.20.0已用官方npm registry只读核实存在（npm view --registry=https://registry.npmjs.org pnpm@10.20.0 version输出10.20.0）；本次未安装产品依赖或执行构建/测试。"
  ]
}
